    "A clean, steady read of your sitting posture. This is the baseline you'll be coached back to." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine klare, stabile Messung deiner Haltung im Sitzen. An diesem Ausgangswert orientiert sich dein Coaching."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A clean, steady read of your sitting posture. This is the baseline you'll be coached back to."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una lectura clara y estable de tu postura al sentarte. Esta será la referencia a la que te ayudaremos a volver."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una rilevazione chiara e stabile della tua postura da seduto. Sarà il riferimento a cui tornare durante l'esercizio."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "座った姿勢を安定して測定しました。この基準の姿勢に戻れるようにお知らせします。"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Een duidelijke, stabiele meting van je zithouding. Dit is de uitgangshouding waarnaar je wordt teruggeleid."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Чёткое и стабильное измерение осанки сидя. Это исходное положение, к которому приложение поможет вернуться."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A clean, steady read of your standing posture. This is the baseline you'll be coached back to." : {
