    },
    "A one-time setup, about half a minute. Pop your AirPods in and walk tall - head level, eyes on the horizon - while Posture learns your best walking posture. Every walk after this is scored against it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eine einmalige Einrichtung, etwa eine halbe Minute. Setz deine AirPods ein und geh aufrecht, mit geradem Kopf und Blick nach vorn. Dabei lernt Posture deine beste Haltung beim Gehen. Alle weiteren Spaziergänge werden daran gemessen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A one-time setup, about half a minute. Pop your AirPods in and walk tall - head level, eyes on the horizon - while Posture learns your best walking posture. Every walk after this is scored against it."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una configuración inicial de medio minuto. Ponte los AirPods y camina erguido, con la cabeza nivelada y la vista al frente, mientras Posture aprende tu mejor postura al caminar. Las próximas caminatas se evaluarán con esa referencia."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una configurazione iniziale di circa mezzo minuto. Indossa gli AirPods e cammina a testa alta, con lo sguardo verso l'orizzonte, mentre Posture acquisisce la tua postura di riferimento durante la camminata. Le camminate successive saranno valutate rispetto a questa."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "約30秒の初回設定です。AirPodsを装着し、頭を水平にして前を見ながら姿勢よく歩いてください。Postureが歩行時の基準となる姿勢を覚えます。以後のウォーキングはこの基準で評価されます。"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eenmalig instellen, in ongeveer een halve minuut. Doe je AirPods in en loop rechtop, met je hoofd recht en je blik op de horizon. Zo leert Posture je beste loophouding kennen. Elke volgende wandeling wordt hiermee vergeleken."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Разовая настройка займёт около полуминуты. Вставь AirPods и иди с ровной осанкой, держи голову прямо и смотри вперёд. Posture запомнит твою лучшую осанку при ходьбе и будет сравнивать с ней следующие прогулки."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quick chin-tuck warm-up, then %lld minutes sitting tall with your AirPods in. The ring shows your alignment live, and a nudge catches you if you drift." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zieh zum Aufwärmen kurz das Kinn zurück. Sitze dann %#@n@ aufrecht mit deinen AirPods. Der Ring zeigt deine Haltung live und erinnert dich, wenn du zusammensackst."
          },
          "substitutions" : {
            "n" : {
              "argNum" : 1,
              "formatSpecifier" : "lld",
              "variations" : {
                "plural" : {
                  "one" : {
