    "AirPods in, phone in your pocket. Posture reads how tall you carry your head against your saved walking posture; your steps and distance track alongside." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AirPods einsetzen, iPhone einstecken. Posture misst deine Kopfhaltung im Vergleich zu deiner gespeicherten Haltung beim Gehen. Schritte und Strecke werden ebenfalls erfasst."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AirPods in, phone in your pocket. Posture reads how tall you carry your head against your saved walking posture; your steps and distance track alongside."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ponte los AirPods y guarda el iPhone en el bolsillo. Posture compara la posición de tu cabeza con tu postura al caminar guardada y registra tus pasos y la distancia."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Indossa gli AirPods e metti il telefono in tasca. Posture rileva la posizione della testa rispetto alla postura di camminata salvata, registrando anche passi e distanza."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AirPodsを装着し、iPhoneをポケットに入れてください。保存した歩行時の姿勢を基準に頭の位置を測定し、歩数と距離も記録します。"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AirPods in, telefoon in je zak. Posture vergelijkt hoe rechtop je je hoofd houdt met je opgeslagen loophouding. Je stappen en afstand worden ook bijgehouden."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Вставь AirPods и положи телефон в карман. Posture сравнит положение головы с сохранённой осанкой при ходьбе, а также запишет шаги и расстояние."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AirPods in, phone in your pocket. Posture reads how tall you carry your head; your steps and distance track alongside. First, a quick one-time setup to learn your walking posture." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AirPods einsetzen, iPhone einstecken. Posture misst deine Kopfhaltung und erfasst Schritte und Strecke. Zuerst folgt eine kurze einmalige Einrichtung, um deine Haltung beim Gehen zu lernen."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AirPods in, phone in your pocket. Posture reads how tall you carry your head; your steps and distance track alongside. First, a quick one-time setup to learn your walking posture."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ponte los AirPods y guarda el iPhone en el bolsillo. Posture lee la posición de tu cabeza y registra tus pasos y la distancia. Primero, configura la app una sola vez para que aprenda tu postura al caminar."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Indossa gli AirPods e metti il telefono in tasca. Posture rileva la posizione della testa e registra anche passi e distanza. Prima, una breve configurazione iniziale per acquisire la tua postura di camminata."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AirPodsを装着し、iPhoneをポケットに入れてください。頭の位置を測定し、歩数と距離も記録します。まずは初回設定で歩行時の姿勢を覚えます。"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AirPods in, telefoon in je zak. Posture meet hoe rechtop je je hoofd houdt en houdt ook je stappen en afstand bij. Stel eerst eenmalig je loophouding in."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Вставь AirPods и положи телефон в карман. Posture отслеживает положение головы, а также записывает шаги и расстояние. Сначала быстро настроим осанку при ходьбе, это нужно сделать только один раз."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AirPods in, spine long. The streak takes care of itself." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AirPods rein, Rücken aufrichten. Deine Serie wächst ganz nebenbei."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AirPods in, spine long. The streak takes care of itself."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ponte los AirPods y estira la espalda. La racha llegará sola."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Indossa gli AirPods e allunga la schiena. La serie verrà da sé."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AirPodsを装着して、背筋を伸ばしましょう。連続記録もついてきます。"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AirPods in, rug recht. Je reeks volgt vanzelf."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Вставь AirPods, выпрямись и продолжай серию."
          }
        }
      }
    },
