    "Posture+ unlocks every level above it: longer holds, higher bars, and the training dose that actually rebuilds your default posture." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Posture+ schaltet alle höheren Level frei: längeres Halten, höhere Ziele und mehr Übung für deine Haltung im Alltag."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Posture+ unlocks every level above it: longer holds, higher bars, and the training dose that actually rebuilds your default posture."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Posture+ desbloquea todos los niveles superiores: más tiempo, objetivos más altos y entrenamiento para ayudarte a mejorar tu postura habitual."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Posture+ sblocca tutti i livelli successivi: più tempo in posizione, obiettivi più alti e più esercizio per lavorare sulla tua postura abituale."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Posture+では、その先のすべてのレベルが利用可能になります。キープする時間と目標が増え、普段の姿勢を整えるための練習を重ねられます。"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Posture+ ontgrendelt alle hogere levels: langer volhouden, hogere doelen en meer oefening om aan je houding te werken."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
